pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 20]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 2 · YOUR SETUP — STEP 1 OF 4}
  - elementId: stepnum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 90, 110, 60]
    content: {style: "$stepnum", wrap: false, text: "1"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 96, 726, 44]
    content: {style: "$title", fontSize: 27, wrap: false, text: Open your handout and log into IRIS}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 160, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1 832,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: do-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 182, 300, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: DO THIS NOW}
  - elementId: steps
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 210, 500, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      text: |
        <p><strong>1.</strong> Find your team handout (paper or message from your facilitator).
        It lists your team's logins and the event addresses.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>2.</strong> Open a browser tab and go to the IRIS address:
        <span style="background-color:$palegreen"> http://&lt;event-address&gt;:8081 </span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>3.</strong> Log in with your <strong>team</strong> IRIS login
        (looks like <strong>team-04</strong>) and the password from the handout.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>4.</strong> You should see the incident ticket queue.
        If you do, this step is done.</p>
  - elementId: check-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 210, 2, 220]
    viewBox: [2, 220]
    points: "1,0 1,220"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: check-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 182, 272, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: HOW TO CHECK}
  - elementId: check-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 210, 272, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>You see a list of tickets with statuses like <strong>available</strong>.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">Login failed? Re-read the team name — it is the team login,
        not your personal seat login.</p>
  - elementId: why-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 350, 272, 80]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: IRIS is where work is claimed. Nobody can answer questions for a ticket until some team owns it.
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "6"}
